{"id": 1012701, "slug": "days-without-incident", "name": "Days Without Incident", "name_original": "Days Without Incident", "description": "<h3>VINTAGE SURVIVAL HORROR</h3><p><strong>Days Without Incident</strong> is a short, never-before-seen horror experience from We Create Stuff. This lost prototype from 2017 reveals the creative roots of In Sound Mind.</p><p>Take a nostalgia trip back to the 2010s: keep an eye on your health, make every bullet count, and solve intriguing puzzles as you navigate a haunted factory.</p><h3>DON'T DRINK THE WATER</h3><p>Working off no more than an old newspaper clipping, you've come to the town of Ebenflow to find the answers you've been hunting for. Its people live in the shadow of an awful tragedy; they may want to forget, but you've come to find the truth of what happened to the factory and its workers.  Why doesn't anyone drink the water?</p><h3>Features:</h3><ul><li><p><strong>A Lost Prototype: </strong>Experience a previously-unreleased piece of horror history.</p></li><li><p><strong>Noir-Drenched Mystery: </strong>Investigate an abandoned metalworks factory that’s plagued by sickness, whispers, and silence. Piece together the hidden truth, and what’s been left to fester…</p></li><li><p><strong>The DNA of Indie Horror: </strong>An evolutionary milestone between Nightmare House: The Original Mod and In Sound Mind.</p></li><li><p><strong>Designed to Linger: </strong>This survival horror experience is a short 45-60 minutes, sharp and unsettling.</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-10-22", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-10-24T14:25:55", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/509/509aa49e2259e756abb559b6b794c3ad.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f76/f76fd360179aa0ea71df0bb963ea73ba.jpg", "website": "https://wecreatestuff.com/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 3, "added_by_status":